{"articleNo":"2779","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2779&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011 신입생 수강확인 및 변경기간 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.03.05","hit":"14151","attachments":[{"name":"첨부파일3.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2779&attachNo=2682"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">신입생 수강신청내역 확인 및 교양선택과목 수강신청 기간 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">◆ 신입생 수강신청내역 확인</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 30.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> [첨부1]</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 파일의 학부(과)별 1학년 1학기 필수과목 현황과 실제 개인별 수강신청 된 과목간의 내역을 대조한 후 총과목수 및 학점이 맞는 지를 확인</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(단, 기초학력과목 수강자는 기초수학은 대학수학1,&nbsp; 기초물리는 일반물리학1, 기초화학은 일반화학1 과목을 대신함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 52.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -52.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 개인별 수강신청 내역 조회</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 52.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -52.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">본교 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">홈페이지(www.kumoh.ac.kr) 우측 원스톱&nbsp;서비스 클릭 →&nbsp;로그</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\">인</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"> →&nbsp;수업(학생) → 수강신청 및 금학기 성적내역 조회 메뉴 이용</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 29.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 위의 내용을 확인한 후 상이한 점이 있으면 아래 연락처로 문의</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 54pt; TEXT-INDENT: -54pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 글로</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">벌관종합학사행정실 : 478-7598</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 54pt; TEXT-INDENT: -54pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(토목환경, 건축학부, 산업공학부, 에너지․융합소재, 소재디자인,</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">경영학과)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 54pt; TEXT-INDENT: -54pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 테크노관종합학사행정실 : 478-7359 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 54pt; TEXT-INDENT: -54pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(기계계열, 신소재시스템공학부, 자연과학부) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 54pt; TEXT-INDENT: -54pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 디지털관종합학사행정실 : 478-7751</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 54pt; TEXT-INDENT: -54pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(전자공학부, 컴퓨터공학과, 컴퓨터소프트웨어공학과)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 54pt; TEXT-INDENT: -54pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 교무연구처 : 478-7029(기타 문의사항)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 54pt; TEXT-INDENT: -54pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 월～금 사이에 문의(주말제외)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br><br>◆ 신입생 교양선택과목 수강 신청 기간 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 신입생 수강신청기간 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 2011. 3. 8(화) 10:00～18:00</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">까지</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 수강신청 과목 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1학년(주,야간 모두 가능) 교양선택과목에 한하며</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;기수강 신청된 필수과목 포함하여 최대 21학점까지&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 신청 가능</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;⇒ 단, 기초수학, 기초물리, 기초화학 과목 및 영어읽기와이해<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (34-38분반)은 선택 불가</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 54pt; TEXT-INDENT: -54pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;⇒ 기존 재학생 변경기간인 3.9～3.11사이에는 별도로 변경기간을 부여하지 않으며, 부득이 변경하</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">고자 할 경우 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">[첨부2]</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">파일을&nbsp; 작성하여 종합학사행정실로 제출(각 관별 1층에 있음)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 54pt; TEXT-INDENT: -54pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;⇒ 연락처는 위의 각관별 연락처 참고 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 개설강좌 및 수강정원 조회 방법</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 58.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -58.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;⇒ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">「원스톱서비스→수업→개설강좌조회」</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 메뉴에서 확인한 후</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 60.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -60.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1학년 교양선택과목에 대한 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">수강여석이 남은 강좌에 대하여</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">[첨부3]</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">과 같은 방법으로 수강신청</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 60.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -60.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;⇒ 개설강좌 조회 코드 : 교양과정(LA0)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;교양과정(야간)(LA1)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">교무연구처장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
